  "description": "ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE — not real company or product data. Item-level SUCCESSOR passport for an ex-EV lithium-ion pack (NMC 622, ~380 kg) repurposed into a stationary storage unit. The original EV passport is linked by lifecycle.predecessorRefs; under Reg (EU) 2023/1542 Art 77(7) the repurposing operator takes responsibility for this new passport. Battery-specific attributes (state of health, performance, labels, due diligence) are carried by the batteries profile, which imports the Battery Pass data model v1.2 — not reproduced here. The environmentalFootprint block is a voluntary, illustrative estimate per kWh: the regulatory Art 7 declaration is not yet applicable (see fieldStatus). Per-metal recycledContentDetail is likewise voluntary ahead of the Art 8 documentation obligation.",
